- * through the ESP32-P4 interrupt matrix to CLIC slot 17 (first external
- * peripheral slot), dispatched by the ESP32-P4 CLIC irqchip driver.
- * INTMTX routing is handled by the CLIC irqchip driver via the 2-cell
- * interrupt specifier in the DTS.
- */
